        // and `Run` all return `ret i32 42`. Package-image construction, manifest corruption and
        // sourceless resolution are not expressible via the compile helpers, so this resolves
        // `Facade` as a sibling source module, compiles the `Demo` consumer to LLVM, and asserts the
        // LLVM contains the folded `ret i32 42`.
